      "id": "HGT-020",
      "criteria": [
        {
          "id": "C20.1",
          "statement": "grammar:** enumerate all four base prefix shapes with none, expiry, recent-root, and expiry+recent-root verifiers (16 combinations). Reject reversed/duplicate/misplaced verifiers, bad tuple lengths, unknown flags, non-VERIFY account validation, mismatched resolved sender, atomic prefix and VERIFY after payment. Classify protocol frame shape before reading sender state. Reject expired deadlines. Keep block-valid private transactions separately testable.",
          "clauses": [
            "EIP-8141 Mempool/Behavior/Introspection",
            "EIP-8272 Public mempool handling"
          ],
          "files": [
            "pkg/core/types/frame_8141_pool.go",
            "pkg/core/vm/frame_8141.go",
            "pkg/core/execution/frame_8141.go"
          ],
          "tests": [
            "github.com/eth2030/eth2030/core/execution::TestFrameCAllSixteenPrefixesExecuteAndCaptureDependencies",
            "github.com/eth2030/eth2030/core/types::TestFrame8141PublicRootGrammar",
            "github.com/eth2030/eth2030/core/types::TestFrame8141PublicSixteenPrefixShapes"
          ],
          "scope": "selected profiles; public gates unchanged"
        },
        {
          "id": "C20.2",
          "statement": "work and stop:** signature validation cost plus declared prefix execution limits must be at most 100000; state limits at most 500000. Exercise equality and +1, including 16 cold root keys and default-account creation. Execute through successful completion of the payer-setting frame, never the body. Failed/caught banned validation behavior cannot be hidden by an outer success. Reverted approval does not terminate validation.",
          "clauses": [
            "EIP-8141 Mempool/Behavior/Introspection",
            "EIP-8272 Public mempool handling"
          ],
          "files": [
            "pkg/core/types/frame_8141_pool.go",
            "pkg/core/vm/frame_8141.go",
            "pkg/core/execution/frame_8141.go"
          ],
          "tests": [
            "github.com/eth2030/eth2030/core/types::TestFrameCPublicWorkBudgetEquality",
            "github.com/eth2030/eth2030/txpool::TestCanonicalFrame8141PoolPrefixDoesNotExecuteBody"
          ],
          "scope": "selected profiles; public gates unchanged"
        },
        {
          "id": "C20.3",
          "statement": "trace:** enforce storage ownership, code/existence/delegation constraints, zero-value helper calls, banned opcode rules, GAS immediately followed by CALL-family instructions, deployment only at sender and nonempty deployed code. Restrictions apply at all call depths. Entry dispatch of the sender and the permitted default-code behavior are not interchangeable with generic third-party calls.",
          "clauses": [
            "EIP-8141 Mempool/Behavior/Introspection",
            "EIP-8272 Public mempool handling"
          ],
          "files": [
            "pkg/core/types/frame_8141_pool.go",
            "pkg/core/vm/frame_8141.go",
            "pkg/core/execution/frame_8141.go"
